      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "TO: COMMISSIONERS AND HEADS OF AGENCIES\n\nFROM: ROBERT F. WAGNER, MAYOR\n\nSUBJECT: NEW YORK CITY FALLOUT SHELTER SURVEY",
